			<Property name="English" value="The Vy'keen are warlike beings from the Dryn'dargh system, obsessed with the defeat of the Sentinels. Controlled by the Vy'keen High Command, they fight the Sentinel menace across the galaxy.&#xA;&#xA;Despite their aggressive appearances, the Vy'keen are bound by a strict code of honour. They value loyalty, sacrifice and a good death above material goods or knowledge, and are sworn to aid the Traveller whenever possible." />
