			<Property name="Id" value="FREIGHTER_CORE_ACT2_14_DESC" />
			<Property name="English" value="I do not know who will read this message. I do not know if anything will survive. But I must die as I lived – I will record it all, even in the face of oblivion...&#xA;&#xA;The swarm came to every world. The drones acted erratically... not attacking, just watching. Time passed and the Sentinels did not seem so much of a threat anymore. They were peaceful now, we thought. We had been forgiven.&#xA;&#xA;We were wrong." />
