			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_CORE_EPI_2_RES" />
			<Property name="English" value="I ask the ATLAS if it wants to live. It is silent again. As I move to leave, it speaks, its voice full of static. It asks for a final gift. It wishes to live, if it can remember me. It asks for a copy of my own mind.&#xA;&#xA;I ask why it does not just simulate me. It does not answer, and I feel almost sorry for the thing. I do as it asks, allowing it to scan me. The KORVA stutters as we do.&#xA;&#xA;I leave. The ATLAS is alone." />
