			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_TRAVELLER_LANG_15" />
			<Property name="English" value="The Atlas was silent in the face of their sin. They would – &lt;AUDIO&gt;TXT_RadioNoise&lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;zzkkt&lt;&gt; – hear the voice of God, and in their agony they would know that they were – &lt;AUDIO&gt;TXT_RadioNoise&lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kkttzzkkt&lt;&gt; –&#xA;The other Travellers, they are not dead – &lt;AUDIO&gt;TXT_RadioNoise&lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;zzzkkkt&lt;&gt; - They never were. Nothing dies. Just as you won’t... - &lt;AUDIO&gt;TXT_RadioNoise&lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kkzkzkt&lt;&gt; –&#xA;These graves are not monuments. They are – &lt;AUDIO&gt;TXT_RadioNoise&lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzkzkt&lt;&gt; - echoes of those who have been taken there... traces of voices that forever scream..." />
