		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ABAN_DESC_27">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ABAN_DESC_27" />
			<Property name="English" value="I have found something. It was just an abandoned building, just a small shack in some forsaken wasteland. I expected nothing more than brief respite from the storm. But what I found...&#xA; &#xA;I approached the terminal and began to read. &quot;It looked like a wound on the world...&quot;" />
