			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ABAN_DESC_29" />
			<Property name="English" value="A world of green skies and an obsidian moon. It is my world. It has to be. All claimed it did not exist, and yet here I am, reading of its supposed destruction. Reading of an impossible paradox, of time and cataclysm.&#xA; &#xA;I need to get back. It is the only purpose I have left. Surely you can understand that.&#xA; &#xA;It was then that my voice helped me. It was then that I learned of the portals." />
